<h3 id="option-2-setting-up-the-local-neon-mcp-server" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Option 2: Setting up the Local Neon MCP Server</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#option-2-setting-up-the-local-neon-mcp-server" aria-label="Link to Option 2: Setting up the Local Neon MCP Server"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
<p>This method runs the Neon MCP server locally on your machine, using a Neon API key for authentication.</p>
<ol>
<li>
<p>Open your terminal.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Run the following command to install the Local Neon MCP server for use with Claude Desktop:</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="bash"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">npx</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> @neondatabase/mcp-server-neon</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> init</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> $NEON_API_KEY</span></span></code></pre><button class="invisible absolute right-4 border border-gray-new-80 bg-white p-1.5 text-gray-new-40 opacity-0 transition-[background-color,opacity,visibility] duration-200 group-hover/code-block:visible group-hover/code-block:opacity-100 hover:bg-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:bg-black-pure dark:text-gray-new-60 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8 lg:visible lg:opacity-100 top-[min(1rem,calc(50%-.8175rem))]" type="button" aria-label="Copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-current"><rect width="8.995" height="9.002" x="5.939" y="5.935" stroke="currentColor" rx="1"></rect><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.434.935a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5 1.5v7.001a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5 1.5h1.499a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1h-1.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5V2.435a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h6.995a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v1.5a.5.5 0 1 0 1 0v-1.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5-1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></figure>
<blockquote>
<p>Make sure to replace <code>$NEON_API_KEY</code> with your actual Neon API key. You can generate one through the Neon Console by following the instructions in <a class="" href="/docs/manage/api-keys#creating-api-keys">Creating API keys</a>.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>You will be prompted to install the required dependencies. Type <code>y</code> to proceed. You should see output similar to this:</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="bash"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">npx</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> @neondatabase/mcp-server-neon</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> init</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> napi_xxxx</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">Need</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> to</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> install</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> the</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> following</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> packages:</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">@neondatabase/mcp-server-neon@0.x.x</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">Ok</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> to</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> proceed?</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> (y) y</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="5"></span>
<span class="line" data-line="6"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">Config</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> written</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> to:</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> /Users/USERNAME/Library/Application</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="7"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">The</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> Neon</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> MCP</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> server</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> will</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> start</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> automatically</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> the</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> next</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> time</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> you</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> open</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> Claude.</span></span></code></pre><button class="invisible absolute right-4 border border-gray-new-80 bg-white p-1.5 text-gray-new-40 opacity-0 transition-[background-color,opacity,visibility] duration-200 group-hover/code-block:visible group-hover/code-block:opacity-100 hover:bg-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:bg-black-pure dark:text-gray-new-60 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8 lg:visible lg:opacity-100 top-4" type="button" aria-label="Copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-current"><rect width="8.995" height="9.002" x="5.939" y="5.935" stroke="currentColor" rx="1"></rect><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.434.935a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5 1.5v7.001a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5 1.5h1.499a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1h-1.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5V2.435a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h6.995a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v1.5a.5.5 0 1 0 1 0v-1.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5-1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></figure>
</li>
<li>
<p>Restart Claude Desktop. You can do so by quitting the Claude Desktop and opening it again.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 id="verifying-the-connection" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Verifying the connection</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#verifying-the-connection" aria-label="Link to Verifying the connection"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
<p>You can verify that the connection to the Neon MCP server either remote or local is successful by following these steps:</p>
<ol>
<li>In Claude click on the search and tools icon to see the available tools.
<span aria-owns="rmiz-modal-" data-rmiz=""><span data-rmiz-content="not-found" style="visibility:visible"><img alt="Claude available tools" loading="lazy" width="704" height="447" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent;width:100%;height:100%" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fguides%2Fimages%2Fclaude_mcp%2Fclaude_available_tools.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fguides%2Fimages%2Fclaude_mcp%2Fclaude_available_tools.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fguides%2Fimages%2Fclaude_mcp%2Fclaude_available_tools.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7"/></span></span></li>
<li>You should see the Neon MCP server&#x27;s tools listed. Click on the <strong>neon</strong> tool to see the available tools in detail.
<span aria-owns="rmiz-modal-" data-rmiz=""><span data-rmiz-content="not-found" style="visibility:visible"><img alt="Claude list available tools" loading="lazy" width="704" height="447" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent;width:100%;height:100%" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fguides%2Fimages%2Fclaude_mcp%2Fclaude_list_available_tools.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fguides%2Fimages%2Fclaude_mcp%2Fclaude_list_available_tools.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fguides%2Fimages%2Fclaude_mcp%2Fclaude_list_available_tools.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7"/></span></span></li>
<li>Claude is now connected to Neon&#x27;s remote MCP server.</li>
</ol>
<p>Ask Claude <code>&quot;List my Neon projects&quot;</code>. If it works, you&#x27;ll see your projects listed by Claude, fetched using the <strong>Neon API</strong>. For example, you might see output similar to this:</p>
<p><span aria-owns="rmiz-modal-" data-rmiz=""><span data-rmiz-content="not-found" style="visibility:visible"><img alt="Claude output" loading="lazy" width="704" height="447" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent;width:100%;height:100%" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fguides%2Fimages%2Fclaude_mcp%2Fclaude_list_project.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fguides%2Fimages%2Fclaude_mcp%2Fclaude_list_project.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fguides%2Fimages%2Fclaude_mcp%2Fclaude_list_project.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7"/></span></span></p>
<h2 id="using-neon-mcp-server" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Using Neon MCP server</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#using-neon-mcp-server" aria-label="Link to Using Neon MCP server"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
<p>Neon MCP server lets you manage Neon via <strong>Neon API calls</strong></p>
<h3 id="neon-platform-operations" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Neon platform operations</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#neon-platform-operations" aria-label="Link to Neon platform operations"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>List databases:</strong> <code>&quot;What databases do I have in my Neon project?&quot;</code></li>
<li><strong>Create a new Neon project</strong>: <code>&quot;Create a new Neon named my-project&quot;</code></li>
<li><strong>Create a new database</strong>: <code>&quot;Create a new database called my-database in the Neon project named my-project&quot;</code></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="simple-sql-queries" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Simple SQL queries</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#simple-sql-queries" aria-label="Link to Simple SQL queries"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Insert records&quot;</strong> <code>&quot;Create a table named posts with 20 records.&quot;</code></li>
<li><strong>Query a table:</strong> <code>&quot;Show me 10 posts from &#x27;posts&#x27; table in database &#x27;my-database&#x27; of project &#x27;my-project&#x27;&quot;</code> (Triggers <code>run_sql</code> action to execute query)</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="schema-exploration" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Schema exploration</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#schema-exploration" aria-label="Link to Schema exploration"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>List tables:</strong> <code>&quot;What tables are in database &#x27;my-database&#x27; of project &#x27;my-project&#x27;?&quot;</code> (Triggers <code>get_database_tables</code> action to get table list)</li>
<li><strong>Table schema:</strong> <code>&quot;Show schema of &#x27;posts&#x27; table in database &#x27;my-database&#x27; of project &#x27;my-project&#x27;&quot;</code> (Triggers <code>describe_table_schema</code> action to describe schema)</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="quick-example-neon-mcp-server-in-action" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Quick example: Neon MCP server in action</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#quick-example-neon-mcp-server-in-action" aria-label="Link to Quick example: Neon MCP server in action"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
<p>Imagine you want to add a column to a table in your Neon project. Instead of writing SQL migrations and directly calling the Neon API, with Neon MCP server and Claude, you can say: <code>&quot;In my social network Neon project, edit the posts table and add a deleted_at column.&quot;</code></p>
<div class="relative overflow-hidden"><img alt="" width="960" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="relative" style="color:transparent" src="data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg width=&#x27;960&#x27; height=&#x27;1080&#x27; xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27; version=&#x27;1.1&#x27;%3E%3C/svg%3E"/></div>
<p>Using Neon MCP server, Claude will:</p>
<ol>
<li><strong>Confirm project:</strong> Check which project you are referring to.</li>
<li><strong>Check schema:</strong> Look at the <code>posts</code> table structure.</li>
<li><strong>Make migration:</strong> Create the SQL to add the column</li>
<li><strong>Preview changes:</strong> Show you the changes in a safe, temporary branch leveraging Neon&#x27;s branching feature.</li>
<li><strong>Apply changes:</strong> After you approve, apply the change to your database.</li>
<li><strong>Confirm success:</strong> Tell you the column is added and prompt you to commit the migration.</li>
</ol>
<p>This shows how Neon MCP server simplifies and makes database management safer with natural language, all powered by the <strong>Neon API</strong> under the hood.</p>
<h2 id="real-world-use-cases" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Real-world use cases</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#real-world-use-cases" aria-label="Link to Real-world use cases"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
<p>Neon MCP server can be used in various scenarios. Here are just a few possibilities:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>SaaS apps:</strong> Faster development with natural language database management</li>
<li><strong>Dev/Test:</strong> Quick database setup for testing</li>
<li><strong>AI agents:</strong> Simple database backend for AI using natural language</li>
<li><strong>Internal tools:</strong> Data access for non-technical teams via natural language interaction</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="security-considerations" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Security considerations</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#security-considerations" aria-label="Link to Security considerations"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
<p>When Claude uses the Neon MCP tool, you&#x27;ll see an authorization prompt: &quot;Allow tool from &quot;neon&quot;?&quot;</p>
<p><span aria-owns="rmiz-modal-" data-rmiz=""><span data-rmiz-content="not-found" style="visibility:visible"><img alt="Claude output" loading="lazy" width="704" height="447" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent;width:100%;height:100%" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fguides%2Fimages%2Fclaude_mcp%2Fclaude_allow_tool.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fguides%2Fimages%2Fclaude_mcp%2Fclaude_allow_tool.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fguides%2Fimages%2Fclaude_mcp%2Fclaude_allow_tool.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7"/></span></span></p>
<p>For your security, review the tool&#x27;s purpose before permitting the operation to proceed. Remember that LLMs can sometimes produce unexpected results, so careful monitoring is always recommended.</p>
<h2 id="conclusion" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Conclusion</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Link to Conclusion"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
<p>Neon MCP server makes database management conversational and easier by enabling natural language interaction with the Neon API. It simplifies tasks, automates processes, and opens new ways to use AI with databases.</p>
